  "note": "dailyAccusationCap and dailyInterruptionCap, in one day, spent by things that actually say something (focus-d6r). Two questions are answered and twelve accusation rungs are delivered — six ambient glyph landings and the six PANEL rungs they escalate into — and EIGHT interruptions reach the person, which is the shared cap, so the last two subjects are refused. The two limits must genuinely compete or 'shared' is a word with no consequence; dailyInterruptionCap is deliberately less than dailyQueryCap plus dailyAccusationCap, and this is the fixture in which that arithmetic is felt. RE-RECORDED: every accusation in this day used to be accuse:ambient and each was de-escalated by a 'returned' outcome, so the ladder never climbed and the budget this fixture exhausted was exhausted ENTIRELY BY GLYPH LANDINGS — six pictures nobody was spoken to by, certified here as the reason the app fell silent. That is focus-d6r's defect committed as expected behaviour, and it survived focus-ndh because focus-ndh repaired InterventionLog.budget and not NudgeReplay, so this lane went on measuring the old arithmetic. The rungs that spend a cap are the rungs that carry a sentence.",
